  with rounded corners, a cyan glow outline and a soft drop shadow — the
  charcoal panels are gone, so the HUD matches the title screen's navy
  glass instead of reading as a separate dark theme. */
  .panel { position: absolute; background: rgba(6, 60, 133, 0.88); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.35); border-radius: 14px; padding: 10px 14px; backdrop-filter: blur(2px); box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3), 0 0 10px rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.12); } /* v10: 0.88 (was 0.55) — a bright cloud behind a panel washed it milky in the v9 landing shot */
